OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fbe some patchy light rain in the
OL,7,Fnorthwest this evening, with heavier
OL,8,Fand more persistent outbreaks moving
OL,9,Fin across Northern Ireland and
OL,10,FScotland overnight, accompanied by
OL,11,Fbrisk winds. Mostly dry elsewhere with
OL,12,Fsome clear spells, and generally warm.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FHeavy rain in the north will
OL,15,Fease and move away northeastwards on
OL,16,FTuesday, replaced by sunshine and
OL,17,Flocally heavy showers. England and
OL,18,FWales mostly dry with some hot
OL,19,Fsunshine developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
